@base = http://localhost:8080

### Styled catalogue (200)
GET {{base}}/books

### English form (200)
GET {{base}}/books/new?lang=en

### Russian form (200), language is stored in the session
GET {{base}}/books/new?lang=ru

### Invalid form: three field errors, no book created (200 HTML)
POST {{base}}/books?lang=en
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

title=&author=Joshua+Bloch&year=1200&genre=&available=true

### Custom constraint (200 HTML with errors)
POST {{base}}/books?lang=ru
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

title=Effective+Java&author=Bloch+2018&year=2018&genre=TECHNOLOGY

### Valid form (302; following GET is 200 and flash appears once)
POST {{base}}/books?lang=en
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

title=Spring+MVC+in+Practice&author=Arzum+Kassymzhanov&year=2026&genre=TECHNOLOGY&available=true

### Missing book on page: 404 text/html
GET {{base}}/books/999?lang=en

### Missing book in API: 404 application/problem+json
GET {{base}}/api/books/999?lang=en

### Variant 12: matching query (200 JSON)
GET {{base}}/api/books/search?q=Java

### Variant 12: query too short (400 ProblemDetail)
GET {{base}}/api/books/search?q=a&lang=en

### Variant 12: missing query (400 ProblemDetail)
GET {{base}}/api/books/search

### Variant 12: 61 characters (400 ProblemDetail)
GET {{base}}/api/books/search?q=xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx

### Variant 12: Russian method validation message
GET {{base}}/api/books/search?q=a&lang=ru

### Original lab 5 filter (200)
GET {{base}}/api/books?author=Bloch&limit=1

### Original lab 5 create (201 + Location)
POST {{base}}/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"Pro Spring 6","author":"Cosmina","year":2023}

### Original lab 5 error statuses
GET {{base}}/api/books/abc

### 404
GET {{base}}/api/nothing

### 405
DELETE {{base}}/api/books

### 415
POST {{base}}/api/books
Content-Type: text/plain

hello

### 406
GET {{base}}/api/books
Accept: application/xml
